# BuildKit uses this in place of a repo-root .dockerignore when building with
# `-f pcbjam/Dockerfile`, so the Docker context stays tiny (a few MB of board +
# scripts) instead of the whole repo (renders, fabrication, archive, .git ...).
*
!codemyriad-protogon.kicad_pcb
!codemyriad-protogon.kicad_pro
!JLC2KiCad_lib
!pcbjam
